<p>Neal Stephenson: <a href="https://nealstephenson.substack.com/p/writing-by-hand-is-good-for-your">Writing by Hand is Good for your Brain - Here's how to do it</a>:</p>
<blockquote>
<p>About twenty-five years ago I stopped composing at the keyboard and switched over to fountain pen on paper. Since then I have written many thousands of pages that way. The manuscript of The Baroque Cycle was a stack of handwritten pages 42 inches high.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Good lord, how cool is that? As a fountain pen using, hand-writing sort, I found this to be a great read.</p>
